  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Solution": "Include yourself when counting the fundraisers: there are \\(1+5=6\\) people. Dividing the total equally gives\n\\[\n1500\\div6=250.\n\\]\nEach person needs to raise \\(\\boxed{250}\\) dollars, choice \\(\\text{A}\\).",
